        "en": "Recipes for making vlogs, one skill per topic (travel, food, daily life, product review, product ad, talking head, podcast clips, tutorial, explainer, news and documentary, promo and showreel): structure and sample ranges with sources for pacing, transitions, graphics, hook, text, sound and look, from which the agent writes the project's edit plan and review profile. Around them: ideate (the angle and brief from the footage), plan, hook-script (story, hook and script sized to the measured voice) and publish (platform data, cover, chapters, captions). Includes a library pack of vlog text styles, stickers and transitions, and scene-prompt for AI video prompts.",
